From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] anbernic: suppress the U-Boot logo for RG353PS

Keep the bootloader stage visually blank so the Linux-stage BaseOS splash
is the only full-screen startup logo. Linux continues to load the optional
/mnt/SDCARD/bootlogo/bootlogo.bmp after userdata is mounted.

Do not patch generic splash.c or splash_source.c: those changes enable the
U-Boot splash loader and are not needed for this behavior.

---
 configs/anbernic-rgxx3-rk3566_defconfig | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/configs/anbernic-rgxx3-rk3566_defconfig b/configs/anbernic-rgxx3-rk3566_defconfig
--- a/configs/anbernic-rgxx3-rk3566_defconfig
+++ b/configs/anbernic-rgxx3-rk3566_defconfig
@@ -90,0 +91,3 @@
+# CONFIG_VIDEO_LOGO is not set
+# CONFIG_SPLASH_SCREEN is not set
+# CONFIG_SPLASH_SOURCE is not set
